=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=75d4d64dfaf3e2128de04d33bdf17c3e, https://si.imgix.net/ef1c80da/uploads/origins/b19227a8-2619-4365-82b5-90fd2a549692?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6369f1b5d930ba54a705a3a275163bb1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ef1c80da/uploads/origins/b19227a8-2619-4365-82b5-90fd2a549692?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f99afd33ec11619f2c3169a9fde85aee 3x"}, "body": "Hello!! I saw your art of Guilmon and absolutely loved your style, I was absolutely overjoyed to learn you have skeb! Also, I hope you enjoy watching the show! I've heard it's extremely good.\n\nFor my request, I'd love it if you could actually draw my fanmade digimon! His name is Furomon! He's based off of a ferret or a weasel. He's got the personality of a troublemaker, but he's got love and peace in his heart. I would be thrilled if you could draw him in whatever way you like, feel free to have fun with it!! Of course, I'd love a piece similar to the guimon you drew, but I'd be happy with anything you drew!", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@mobirou/works/12", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3643251, "client_id": 2044265, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9014fab8/uploads/origins/bdcdf57a-df37-4dc9-b1f9-67d0882a8c79?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f147e21c578b43a3616caa3c32257b14", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9014fab8/uploads/origins/bdcdf57a-df37-4dc9-b1f9-67d0882a8c79?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f147e21c578b43a3616caa3c32257b14, https://si.imgix.net/9014fab8/uploads/origins/bdcdf57a-df37-4dc9-b1f9-67d0882a8c79?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0dfc3dc2b2aa1c74296a5bbc2b0e9355 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9014fab8/uploads/origins/bdcdf57a-df37-4dc9-b1f9-67d0882a8c79?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0ad839f5f330e622927652757413beb0 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9014fab8/uploads/origins/bdcdf57a-df37-4dc9-b1f9-67d0882a8c79?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2e5c962bc6d145b5ad968b5197c1f2d2", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9014fab8/uploads/origins/bdcdf57a-df37-4dc9-b1f9-67d0882a8c79?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2e5c962bc6d145b5ad968b5197c1f2d2, https://si.imgix.net/9014fab8/uploads/origins/bdcdf57a-df37-4dc9-b1f9-67d0882a8c79?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=67034fe13e235d8899045d87055b59cb 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9014fab8/uploads/origins/bdcdf57a-df37-4dc9-b1f9-67d0882a8c79?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=573e4d71981ce8e61a06ceea0d461ee1 3x"}, "body": "こんにちは、藻尾郎様。\n\n初めてご依頼させていただきます。動物の絵を描くのが好きだって知って、本当に嬉しい！\n\n四足歩行のを拝見していた際、その独特のタッチに心を奪われました…！\n\nぜひ、うちのこキャラクターを藻尾郎様の素敵な画風で描いていただけたらと思い、今回ご依頼させていただきました。\n\n参考資料： https://lit.link/alphawolf 上記リンク先の1枚目、黄色い背景に「Kiba」と書かれているイラストを最も参考にしています\n\n僕のキャラクターは装飾品が一切ない、ただ純粋な白狼です。キャラクターの正面と、胸元のふさふさとしたモフモフな毛並みを、特に強調して魅力的に描いてほしいです！キャラクターの詳細やデザインの雰囲気については、以前のこちらの依頼（ https://skeb.jp/requests/1756796　や　https://www.deviantart.com/alphawolf-fangy/art/Teaching-the-new-gererations-656940599 ）もぜひ参考にしていただけますと幸いです。\n\n藻尾郎様のスタイルにてご作画いただけますよう、何卒よろしくお願い申し上げます。", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@mobirou/works/11", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3643251, "client_id": 2781327, "vtt_url": null, "th